{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47739","headline":"寄袁州陈智周 · 沈廷瑞","name":"寄袁州陈智周","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"名山相别後，别後会难期。\n金鼎销红日，丹田老紫芝。\n访君虽有路，怀我岂无诗。\n休羡繁华事，百年能几时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"沈廷瑞","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47739.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47739","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}